 was misleading for the \"is the source older than the memory?\" test. I'd have wanted the hook to show `valid_from` (or \"last confirmed against the code\") inline, so I could judge staleness without opening files.\n\n3. **A way to record an open question (an `open_question` type, or a `needs_confirmation_from` field on `challenge`/`create`).** The useful thing to save was \"it's unknown whether Lena Fischer's approval rule survived REV-7; ask @acme/revenue-eng.\" No existing type fits an unresolved question, so I left it out of the store and only told the user.", "debrief_cost_usd": 0.2707882, "retries": 0}, "rep": 0}
